  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "接管文娱论  (Taking Charge of Entertainment Talk)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the conference room, Chun Yuqiao announces that Unit One has already stepped into Unit Two's studio and backs up his move with three months of ratings charts. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经让一部接管了文娱论的演播室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "从今以后，二部的人归一部现场组的人管。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果有不配合的，马上停职。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一个小时之后开始整合，您看这办法行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是二部成立以来的业绩曲线，包括三个月的收视。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这些在公司都没有分享过吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是你自己念呢，还是我来帮你念？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那咱们就散会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这种事咱们都没干过，林姐还真敢干啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "好像是布小谷送去的亲笔签字函。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经让一部接管了文娱论的演播室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have already had Unit One take over Entertainment Talk's studio.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "从今以后，二部的人归一部现场组的人管。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From today on, Unit Two's staff report to Unit One's floor team.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果有不配合的，马上停职。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Anyone who refuses to cooperate will be suspended at once.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一个小时之后开始整合，您看这办法行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Integration starts in an hour; does this plan work for you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是二部成立以来的业绩曲线，包括三个月的收视。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is Unit Two's performance curve since launch, including three months of ratings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这些在公司都没有分享过吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'None of these numbers have been shared inside the company yet, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是你自己念呢，还是我来帮你念？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will you read them aloud yourself, or shall I read them for you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那咱们就散会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then let us adjourn the meeting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这种事咱们都没干过，林姐还真敢干啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have never done anything this bold; Lin Jie really dared to do it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "好像是布小谷送去的亲笔签字函。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It seems Bu Xiaogu delivered the hand-signed letter.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经让一部接管了文娱论的演播室。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "从今以后，二部的人归一部现场组的人管。",
      "gap": 0.5
